  "_comment_block_badges": "Keyword -> icon for the small mark on a narration block. English here because the bundled system is English; a system or campaign in another language overrides this list rather than editing the display. Matching is substring-based, so it only works for the language these words are in — block KIND (npc/dice/tutor) is badged without any word list and works everywhere."
}
